  "prompt": "How did plans change for users whose first subscription started in 2025? For each such user, take the plan_name of the user's first subscription and the plan_name of the user's latest subscription, then count the users by that pair of plans. A user's subscriptions follow each other by start_date, and no user has two that start on the same day; a user with one subscription has the same first and latest plan. Started in 2025 means the first subscription's start_date is from 1 January to 31 December 2025, both days included. Return three columns, in this order: first_plan, latest_plan and users. Return one row for each pair of plans with users. Any row order is fine.",
